"""Cybersecurity glossary, part 8: methods used by cybercriminals and hackers (attacks, social engineering, malware tricks, telecom and mobile-money fraud).
Same row shape as cyber_terms_1.py. Descriptions explain how an attack works so people can recognise and resist it; they contain no instructions for carrying one out.
Kinyarwanda and Kiswahili are a draft for review by fluent speakers; technical words that people usually keep in English are kept."""


def T(id_, name, aliases, cat, photo, local, en, fr, rw, sw):
    return (id_, name, aliases, cat, photo, local, en[0], en[1], fr[0], fr[1], rw[0], rw[1], sw[0], sw[1])


